      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I received 4 quotes, 3 from Solar Quotes and an extra from a local supplier. Two were superior to the others in that they were quoting with better materials. It finally came down to these two and it was hard to make a decision. I eventually settled on Electro Service Solar as they were to install Australian made panels. Unfortunately, prior to installation, these panels could not be obtained and we settled for another brand of similar quality. The installation team showed up at the scheduled time. They were polite and thoughtful and discussed everything with me throughout the installation. They eventually completed the install just after midday and Matt, the proprietor spent time helping me download the SMA App and explain how to use it and understand the data therein. He also provided me with a pre-completed Application to my electricity provider and explained in detail how I should proceed. I then found it a fairly simple process to lodge the application and my provider has since contacted me with date for the installation of the digital meter. Overall, it was a relatively painless process throughout and I would now be happy to recommend Electro Service Solar to anyone. They were fantastic.",
